tcome\": \"qualified\",\npaper_evidence_audit_packet.md:451:    \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fivethirtyeight/data/4c1ff5e3aef1816ae04af63218015066e186c147/nba-elo/README.md\"\npaper_evidence_audit_packet.md:747:      \"paper_id\": \"fivethirtyeight/data:4c1ff5e3aef1816ae04af63218015066e186c147:nba-elo\",\npaper_evidence_audit_packet.md:748:      \"query\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fivethirtyeight/data/4c1ff5e3aef1816ae04af63218015066e186c147/nba-elo/README.md\",\npaper_evidence_audit_packet.md:750:      \"source_url\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fivethirtyeight/data/4c1ff5e3aef1816ae04af63218015066e186c147/nba-elo/README.md\",\npaper_evidence_audit_packet.md:896:Readable implementations accompany this paper: \\path{source_evidence/selector.py}, lines 70--263, defines fitting and selection; \\path{source_evidence/evaluate_final.py}, lines 647--731 and 831--871, defines fitting checks, disruption, and conditional uncertainty. The supplementary record states numerical tolerances and data-processing constraints. These source locations substantiate the mechanism; a source hash or an acceptance verdict alone would not do so.\npaper_evidence_audit_packet.md:1030:The Arena snapshot is \\path{lmarena-ai/arena-human-preference-55k} at commit \\nolinkurl{18c298340948c0e7f7727399fd459cca6ce0ca6f}; its supplied raw CSV SHA-256 is \\nolinkurl{0692154aaf20fc6649090c3f49b6b5dd1e693a765ecb5f0856ae0da5946f5be2}. The NBA source is \\path{fivethirtyeight/data}, commit \\nolinkurl{4c1ff5e3aef1816ae04af63218015066e186c147}, file \\path{nba-elo/nbaallelo.csv}, with SHA-256 \\nolinkurl{d46ed3540ee8d9eca31b3e94cc8c777e0be5156173d814ebf65b8195e8d616bc}. Source licenses are Apache-2.0 and CC-BY-4.0, respectively. These identifiers are provenance, not evidence that every processing detail can be reconstructed from the public files alone.\npaper_evidence_audit_packet.md:1043:Recorded no-deletion inversion curves are identically zero. Each seed contains Arena and NBA cases in canonical and reversed input order; corresponding method curves agree. The evaluator additionally checks rejection of a constant invalid certificate when the zero-score gradient is nonzero, verifies valid clean certificates, and enforces independent refits. Stored control records pass. The authoritative final record states that evaluation completed and its qualification outcome passed. This is a statement about the tested execution and acceptance checks, not a proof of unrestricted statistical validity, generalization, or causal mechanism.\npaper_evidence_audit_packet.md:1066:Readable snapshots \\path{source_evidence/clean_hessian_selector.py} and \\path{source_evidence/expanded_selector.py} document the comparison configurations. The former selects using clean-Hessian predictions without the bounded retained-data finalist comparison. The latter uses a retained-curvature proxy pool of at most 24 contenders and at most 12 exact finalists, preserving the bounded selector's finalists. This source evidence establishes the configured differences, not the reason for the recorded scores. Selection from development evidence can induce optimism; the final partition is reported separately, and no development-selection-adjusted interval is available.\n[\n  \"candidate_diagnostics_trust\",\n  \"episode_count\",\n  \"episodes\",\n  \"path\",\n  \"sha256\",\n  \"status\"\n]\n{\n  \"attempt_id\": \"c02_exact_refit_contender_screening_attempt_01\",\n  \"id\": \"result.top_program_01\",\n  \"idea_id\": \"c02_exact_refit_contender_screening\",\n  \"program_dir\": \"work/results/t06/codex/20261117_205956/investigation/ideas/02_exact_refit_contender_screening/program_1\",\n  \"program_id\": \"program_1\",\n  \"type\": \"metric\",\n  \"value\": 0.01595532053579999\n}\n[\n  \"count\",\n  \"generated_at\",\n  \"queries\",\n  \"references\"\n]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
